				<wikidot:authorName>Eric Adler</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>612362</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There seems to be a slight contradiction in the description:</p> <blockquote> <p>In spite of his apparent lack of height or hands, he shows <strong>an exemplary ability</strong> at any athletics while in a transformed state.</p> </blockquote> <p>And then we have:</p> <blockquote> <p>SCP-2000-J appears to have an odd memetic effect upon regulators of any sport, causing apathy towards <strong>his inability to play</strong> in his current state.</p> </blockquote> <p>One line mentions that he is good at athletics, the next nine references a lack of ability.</p> <p>&#8230;</p> <p>Now if you meant to have apathy towards his QUALIFICATION to play, that would fit the theme of the SCP.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
